How we can start jenkins in docker

docker ps
docker restart jenkins
docker stop jenkins
docker start jenkins

how to check logs

docker logs jenkins
docker logs -f jenkins

how to expose jenkins 8080?
docker inspect jenkins | grep -i port


how to check jenkins container ke andar network test

docker exec -it jenkins bash
