How to start jenkins with DNS
docker run -d \
  --name jenkins \
  -p 8080:8080 \
  -p 50000:50000 \
  --dns 8.8.8.8 \
  --dns 8.8.4.4 \
  -v jenkins_home:/var/jenkins_home \
  jenkins/jenkins:lts